00:48:49,411 --> 00:48:55,411
Monkey Man is a 2024 action thriller film directed and produced by Dev Patel in his directorial
debut, who also co-wrote the screenplay with Paul Angunawela and John Collee.

11
00:53:42,352 --> 00:53:48,352
The film stars Patel as Kid, a man who seeks vengeance on the
corrupt leaders responsible for his mother's death.

12
00:58:35,294 --> 00:58:41,294
Sharlto Copley, Pitobash, and Vipin Sharma are featured in supporting roles.

13
01:03:28,235 --> 01:03:34,235
Monkey Man premiered at South by Southwest on March 11, 2024, and was released
theatrically in the United States and Canada by Universal Pictures on April 5, 2024.

14
01:08:21,176 --> 01:08:27,176
The film was critically acclaimed and grossed $35 million
worldwide against a $10 million budget.

15
01:13:14,117 --> 01:13:20,117
It was nominated at the 78th BAFTA Awards for Outstanding
Debut by a British Writer, Director or Producer.

16
01:18:07,058 --> 01:18:13,058
The tone is lighthearted.
